From: OpenAI audit
Subject: [PATCH] net: dsa: harden AN8855 Netlink and procfs lifecycle

Publish the AN8855 private pointer only after successful Generic Netlink
registration, unregister before releasing the DSA switch, reject invalid
PHY/DEVAD/register inputs, and propagate regmap/MDIO errors. Make procfs
creation transactional and remove the complete subtree on teardown.

